sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Outlook/Teams
  participant W as Wispr
  participant C as Control API/Temporal
  participant A as agentgateway
  participant L as LiteLLM/Claude
  participant T as Teams reviewer
  participant S as SoR targets
  O->>C: meeting ended/event
  C->>A: find permitted Wispr note
  A->>W: read meeting note
  W-->>A: transcript/summary refs
  A-->>C: sanitized source
  C->>L: structured extraction
  L-->>C: decisions/actions/risks
  C->>T: review card (versioned)
  T->>C: approve/reject signal
  alt approved
    C->>S: publish to Plane/GitHub/Confluence/SharePoint by policy
  else rejected
    C->>C: revise or close without write
  end
